 "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Advogado(a) Pleno &ndash; Contencioso Trabalhista</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">📍</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Modelo h&iacute;brido<br></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🕒</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Regime de associa&ccedil;&atilde;o<br></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🏥</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o com foco no setor de Sa&uacute;de Suplementar</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Estamos em busca de um(a) <strong>Advogado(a) J&uacute;nior </strong>para atuar no contencioso trabalhista, com foco em demandas estrat&eacute;gicas, elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de pe&ccedil;as de alta complexidade e relacionamento direto com clientes.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Procuramos um(a) profissional com s&oacute;lida experi&ecirc;ncia em Direito do Trabalho, autonomia na condu&ccedil;&atilde;o de processos e vis&atilde;o estrat&eacute;gica para contribuir ativamente com os resultados da &aacute;rea.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Principais responsabilidades:</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o e revis&atilde;o de pe&ccedil;as processuais de m&eacute;dia e alta complexidade, incluindo contesta&ccedil;&otilde;es, recursos, contrarraz&otilde;es, agravos, memoriais e manifesta&ccedil;&otilde;es diversas; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">An&aacute;lise cr&iacute;tica de senten&ccedil;as e ac&oacute;rd&atilde;os, com defini&ccedil;&atilde;o de estrat&eacute;gias processuais e recursais; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em audi&ecirc;ncias presenciais e telepresenciais; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Gest&atilde;o integral de carteira de processos trabalhistas, incluindo acompanhamento processual e controle de prazos; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Interface direta com clientes para alinhamentos t&eacute;cnicos e estrat&eacute;gicos; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de relat&oacute;rios, pareceres e orienta&ccedil;&otilde;es jur&iacute;dicas; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Apoio t&eacute;cnico e orienta&ccedil;&atilde;o a estagi&aacute;rios(as) e profissionais em in&iacute;cio de carreira; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Acompanhamento de processos em todas as fases, desde o conhecimento at&eacute; a execu&ccedil;&atilde;o. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o no setor de Sa&uacute;de Suplementar</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">O profissional ter&aacute; contato com demandas trabalhistas relacionadas a:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Profissionais da &aacute;rea da sa&uacute;de (m&eacute;dicos, enfermeiros, t&eacute;cnicos e equipes administrativas); </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Escalas de trabalho, plant&otilde;es, jornadas diferenciadas e banco de horas; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Adicionais de insalubridade, periculosidade, trabalho noturno e horas extras; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Contratos de trabalho e contratos de presta&ccedil;&atilde;o de servi&ccedil;os m&eacute;dicos; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Auditorias trabalhistas e a&ccedil;&otilde;es de preven&ccedil;&atilde;o de passivos; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Atualiza&ccedil;&atilde;o e acompanhamento da jurisprud&ecirc;ncia dos Tribunais Trabalhistas e das altera&ccedil;&otilde;es legislativas aplic&aacute;veis ao segmento. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Perfil desejado:</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Conhecimento s&oacute;lido em Direito do Trabalho e Processo do Trabalho; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Capacidade anal&iacute;tica e vis&atilde;o estrat&eacute;gica; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Organiza&ccedil;&atilde;o e excel&ecirc;ncia na gest&atilde;o de prazos; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Boa comunica&ccedil;&atilde;o escrita e verbal; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Postura profissional para atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em audi&ecirc;ncias e no relacionamento com clientes; </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Interesse ou experi&ecirc;ncia pr&eacute;via no segmento de Sa&uacute;de Suplementar. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Requisitos:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Gradua&ccedil;&atilde;o em Direito e OAB ativa;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Experi</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&ecirc;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">ncia compat</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&iacute;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">vel com posi</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&ccedil;&atilde;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">o de n</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&iacute;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">vel pleno;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Excelente reda</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&ccedil;&atilde;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">o jur</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&iacute;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">dica e capacidade de an</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&aacute;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">lise cr</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&iacute;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">tica;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">✅</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Organiza</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light'; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos;\">&ccedil;&atilde;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">o, autonomia e proatividade.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Diferenciais:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">⭐</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> P&oacute;s-gradua&ccedil;&atilde;o em Direito do Trabalho, Direito da Sa&uacute;de ou &aacute;reas correlatas;<br></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">⭐</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Experi&ecirc;ncia com operadoras de planos de sa&uacute;de, hospitais ou escrit&oacute;rios especializados no setor;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">⭐</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\"> Viv&ecirc;ncia em demandas trabalhistas estrat&eacute;gicas e consultivas.</span></p>",
